{
  "title": "JAMS - Jena Adaptable Modelling System",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "JAMS is a pure-Java, open-source software framework for building and applying modular environmental simulation models. The release bundle includes the model component libraries from the jamsmodels repository.\n<p><br></p>\n<h3>Authors of the model component libraries</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>J2K_base</strong>: Peter Krause, Christian Fischer, Sven Kralisch, Annika Künne, Andrew Watson, Santosh Nepal (contributors: Manfred Fink, Heiko Busch, Holm Kipka, Corina Manusch)</li>\n<li><strong>J2K_ext</strong>: Christian Fischer, Christin Michel, Peter Krause, Manfred Fink, Sven Kralisch, Holm Kipka, Heiko Busch, Santosh Nepal, Carsten Busch, Bjoern Pfennig, Daniel Varga (contributors: Sophie Biskop)</li>\n<li><strong>J2K_iso</strong>: Andrew Watson, Sven Kralisch, Christian Birkel</li>\n<li><strong>J2Kg</strong>: Peter Krause, Christian Fischer, Manfred Fink, Sven Kralisch</li>\n<li><strong>Thornthwaite</strong>: Sven Kralisch, Manfred Fink</li>\n</ul>",
